# Shared CoreDNS data plane for Route 53 / Cloud DNS / Azure DNS.
# The appliance renders every hosted zone as /zones/db.<zone> (RFC 1035 zone file);
# the `auto` plugin loads new/changed/removed files within 2s, so
#   dig @127.0.0.1 -p 1053 www.example.com
# answers from the records you created through the API or console.
. {
    auto {
        directory /zones db\.(.*) {1}
        reload 2s
    }
    errors
    log
}
